{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dda775cb-d424-8672-a3e6-0fbea648daea",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T14:24:10-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:22:28-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:22:32-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. I call about a manhole cover on the street. It is sunk down, and every time a car go over it, it make a loud ring, like bang, bang."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:22:43-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a sunken manhole cover. Where is it exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:22:47-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 402 Narragansett Avenue, in front of my shop. And is right in the bike lane, so is not only the noise. A bike can hit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:22:57-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, in the bike lane at 402 Narragansett. Did this start after the rain over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:23:04-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I notice it more after the rain that ended Saturday. The ground, maybe it is soft now, and the cover go lower. Before was little bit, now is more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:23:15-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens. The road settles around the frame once things get saturated. I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at it. Can I get a name and a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:23:27-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Frank Fiore. The number is 401-555-0191. Sorry, if you hear something rattle, is my phone case. The popsocket is loose and it make noise on the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:23:37-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-one, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:23:42-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:23:44-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, Mr. Fiore. You're all set on the order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:23:48-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I ask, how long it usually take for repair? Days, weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:23:53-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few days to a couple of weeks. Something in a bike lane tends to get looked at sooner, but it depends on what the crew finds under it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:24:04-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that is fine. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T14:24:08-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
